{"title":"Lost Woods","slug":"Lost_Woods","hero":null,"pageid":4088,"revid":21643,"timestamp":"2026-05-17T23:42:25Z","lastEditor":"Matheo12wrc","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<p>The Lost Woods is a newly added area in <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay island</a> as of May 2025's Terrain update, infested with zombies and skeletons, and rarely grUdge. It is low ground near the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lighthouse/\">Lighthouse</a>. There is a waterfall shielding a cave entrance to <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Mike's_Mines/\">Mike's Mines</a>. \n</p><p><b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Petrified_Oak/\">Petrified Oak</a></b> Trees are found here. \n</p><p>Also, Here the new <b>Elderbark</b> axe is also often found, seated in a tree stump.\n</p><p>The <b>Elderbark</b> axe has a 1/40 chance of spawning, which is approximately 2.4%.\n</p><p>This place is also home to one of the quest pedestals for the <b><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe/\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a></b>.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lost Woods (In map)\">Lost Woods (In map)</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Lost Woods (In map)</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Image of the Lost Woods sign and location in Finlay\">Image of the Lost Woods sign and location in Finlay</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Image of the Lost Woods sign and location</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: An image of the location the Lost Woods pedestal used in many Oaklands quests.\">An image of the location the Lost Woods pedestal used in many Oaklands quests.</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Location of the Lost Woods pedestal used in many Oaklands quests</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Image of an Elderbark seated in a tree stump \t \t \t \t\t \t\t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\tblack truffles can be found directly on the ground\">Image of an Elderbark seated in a tree stump \t \t \t \t\t \t\t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\tblack truffles can be found directly on the ground</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Image of an Elderbark seated in a tree stump \t \t \t \t\t \t\t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\tblack truffles can be found directly on the ground\">Image of an Elderbark seated in a tree stump \t \t \t \t\t \t\t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\tblack truffles can be found directly on the ground</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Image of an Elderbark seated in a tree stump</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: black truffles can be found directly on the ground\">black truffles can be found directly on the ground</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: black truffles can be found directly on the ground\">black truffles can be found directly on the ground</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>black truffles can be found directly on the ground</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
